      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>The non-biometric credential used to secure the device (i.e., PIN, pattern, or password). This should typically only be used in combination with a biometric auth type, such as BIOMETRIC_WEAK.</para>
          <para>This corresponds to KeyProperties.AUTH_DEVICE_CREDENTIAL during key generation.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/hardware/biometrics/BiometricManager.Authenticators#DEVICE_CREDENTIAL" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.hardware.biometrics.BiometricManager.Authenticators.DEVICE_CREDENTIAL</code>.</a></format></para>
